  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/named-characters.html\r\n\r\nMany entities are duplicates: one with closing semicolon and one without closing semicolon. But the closing semicolon is not optional. It does not make much sense to list the named characters with semicolon.\r\n\r\nSomething like this might fix it:\r\n\r\n    sed s/;$// | sort -u\r\n",
